			"description": "Define which items to include based on customer selections. Each rule adds an item when its condition is met:<br><br><b>Condition Types:</b><br>• <b>Always</b> - Item is always included<br>• <b>When Equals</b> - Include when option equals a specific value<br>• <b>When Set</b> - Include when a checkbox is checked<br>• <b>When Not Empty</b> - Include when a text field has any value<br>• <b>When Greater/Less Than</b> - Include based on numeric comparison<br>• <b>When In List</b> - Include when value matches any in comma-separated list<br><br><b>Quantity:</b> Set Base Qty directly, or use 'Qty From Option' to pull quantity from a numeric option (multiplied by Qty Multiplier).",
